## Level 3 Stage 4 — the glowing flower.
##
## The bloom sits at the very top of the plant, the highest highlight in the
## level. **The bubble goes low**, at y 1000: at the high position it covered the
## flower almost completely, which is the conflict that decided the two-position
## rule in the first place.
##
## Built to Stage 1's numbers — header at 760 px, tap plank at 1478, three
## cards at y 1610 — and it changes only what is written above. See
## `scripts/levels/level_3/stage_1.gd` for how a Level 3 stage works.
